== For the Rice ==

Heat a large #skillet over medium heat and add @coconut oil{1%Tbsp}. Add the @cauliflower rice{1%lb} and stir to coat. Cover skillet and cook for about ~{2-3%minutes} to steam.

Uncover and stir, then add the @jalapeño pepper{1}(minced), @sea salt{3/4%tsp}, @onion powder{3/4%tsp}, @garlic powder{3/4%tsp}, @chipotle powder{dash} and @fresh lime juice{1-2%Tbsp}. Cook and stir another minute or two uncovered until you have desired texture, then remove from heat and set aside.

== For Chicken, Peppers & Onions ==

Cut @boneless skinless chicken thighs{1 1/2%lbs} into bites size pieces. Season all over with @sea salt{3/4%tsp}, @onion powder{1%tsp}, @garlic powder{1%tsp}, @cumin{1%tsp}, @chili powder{1 1/2%tsp} and @Chipotle powder{large pinch} and heat a large #skillet over medium high heat (you can move the rice to a #bowl and use the same one) and add @coconut oil{1%Tbsp}.

Add chicken and brown all over, stirring as needed. Stir and cook over medium/medium high heat for ~{7%mins} or until cooked through. Lower heat a bit and add the @lime juice{from 2 limes}, stir and continue to cook another ~{2-3%minutes}, then remove from heat and place in a #bowl.

Keep the heat on medium and add another @coconut oil{1%Tbsp} to the #skillet. Add @red bell pepper{1%large}(sliced thin) and @large onion{1}(sliced thin) and stir to coat with fat. Sprinkle with a bit of @sea salt{to taste}, and continue to cook, stirring occasionally, about ~{5%minutes} or until softened and browning, then remove from heat.

== Guacamole ==

To make the guacamole, mash together the @avocados{2} with the @onion{1/4%cup}(minced), @garlic{2%cloves}(minced), @jalapeno pepper{1}(minced), @fresh lime juice{2%Tbsp}, @fresh cilantro{2%Tbsp}(chopped) and @sea salt{to taste}, adjusting seasonings to taste.

== Assemble bowls ==

Layer the cauli rice, chicken, peppers and onions in #bowls{}, then top with guac and any other desired toppings such as @salsa{}, fresh herbs, and sliced jalapeño. Serve right away and enjoy!